OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOrganised
OL,6,Fbands of rain push in from the
OL,7,Fsouthwest through the night bringing
OL,8,Fwidely murky conditions and fog to
OL,9,Fhigh ground. Winds strengthening to
OL,10,Fstrong westerlies, with possible
OL,11,Fcoastal gales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FEarly morning rain pushes
OL,14,Faway to leave sunny spells and
OL,15,Fscattered showers, these heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes with a risk of hail. Strong
OL,17,Fwinds to start, slowly easing by
OL,18,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
