OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fcalmer, bright start to Thursday
OL,7,Fbefore Storm Austen arrives in the
OL,8,Fafternoon bringing heavy rain and
OL,9,Fgales through much of Friday. Further
OL,10,Fwind and rain arrives Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
